VALUES('KRCHN','Paper II','Health Systems & Management','Nursing Education','The learning domain concerned with acquisition of facts, concepts and principles is:','Affective','Cognitive','Evaluative','Psychomotor','B','Bloom''s taxonomy: the cognitive domain covers knowledge acquisition — facts, concepts, principles and their application; the affective domain covers attitudes and values; psychomotor covers skills (Bloom''s taxonomy; nursing education curriculum).','easy',2021,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

