VALUES('KRCHN','Paper II','Community Health Nursing','Occupational Health','The main objective of an occupational health programme is:','To prevent health problems due to normal working conditions','To promote and maintain the highest degree of physical, mental and social health of workers','To assist the injured and disabled for rehabilitation and treatment','To protect workers from factors adverse to their health','B','WHO/ILO define the main objective of occupational health as promoting and maintaining the highest degree of physical, mental and social well-being of workers in all occupations (community health/occupational health texts; Kenya OSH Act).','easy',2021,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

