VALUES('KRCHN','Paper II','Health Systems & Management','Nursing Education','Non-projected teaching aids include:','Diagrams, videos, slides','Slides, videos, pictures','Flipcharts, slides, pictures','Real objects, handouts, pictures','D','Non-projected teaching aids require no projector or power source: real objects, handouts, pictures, charts, flannel boards; slides, videos and films are projected aids (teaching/learning methods; nursing education curriculum).','easy',2021,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

